# Part 5 - Verifying Microsoft Entra Connect

Microsoft Entra Connect Sync was inspected using:

```text
Synchronization Service Manager
```

The Operations page showed successful synchronization operations for both the Active Directory and Microsoft Entra connectors.

Examples included:

```text
Delta Import              Success
Delta Synchronization     Success
Export                    Success
```

This established that Microsoft Entra Connect itself was functioning correctly.

Instead of assuming synchronization was broken, the troubleshooting process showed that the problem existed specifically with **device registration**.

