# Final Takeaway

The biggest lesson from this lab was understanding that Microsoft endpoint management is composed of several connected but independent systems:

```text
Active Directory
      │
      ├── On-premises user identity
      └── On-premises device identity
              │
              ▼
Microsoft Entra Connect
              │
              ▼
Microsoft Entra ID
      │
      ├── Cloud user identity
      └── Cloud device identity
              │
              ▼
Microsoft Intune
      │
      ├── Configuration
      ├── Compliance
      ├── Applications
      └── Remote management
```

A device being visible and manageable in Intune does not automatically mean it is Microsoft Entra joined.

Likewise, synchronizing a user into Microsoft Entra does not automatically synchronize or register the user's Windows computer.

The final successful state for `COMP01` was:

```text
Active Directory Domain Joined     ✅
Microsoft Entra Joined             ✅
Hybrid Microsoft Entra Joined      ✅
Microsoft Intune Managed           ✅
Device Authentication Successful   ✅
```
